      "summary": {
        "en": "Initiates Standoff. After the target in the Standoff is defeated or Weakness Broken, Boothill receives Pocket Trickshot and dispels the Standoff. Boothill gains Enhanced Basic ATK and this turn does not end.",
        "zh-CN": "开启【绝命对峙】，【绝命对峙】的目标被消灭或弱点被击破后，波提欧获得【优势口袋】并解除【绝命对峙】。使自身获得强化普攻，且本回合不会结束。"
      },
